From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mitzev <ogi@kunasystems.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 23:23:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Middle-end: layout bridge + ty hooks for repr(cpp) /
 repr(swift)

rustc_ty_utils gains a `cxx_bridge` module that routes repr(cpp) /
repr(swift) type-layout queries through rustc_abi_cxx for Itanium-correct
empty-class size, subobject placement, and vptr slot allocation. Middle
ty layout recognizes the new repr variants; typeck's call resolution
handles constructor methods.
